 you like to be  together too if you look at the media  that's not what they promoting  that's not what they want they want it  to be a new wedding a new episode a new  tv show and then they have people all  around and my wife here kim filed for  divorce after six years of marriage and  has asked for joint legal and physical  custody of their children north saint  chicago and psalm a source told et at  the time that the rapper was fine with  the joint custody agreement and the two  were committed to co-parenting together  i feel like we are so blessed to have  the best support system and the best  family  to really just support each other no  matter what we're going through the  source also noted that neither kim nor  kanye planned to contest their prenup  and at the time they were in the process  of reaching a property settlement  agreement and while kim has been  supportive of kanye attending his shows  and co-parenting she is currently dating  saturday night live star pete davidson  the two have been spotted out on several  dates since sparking romance rumors back  in october following kim's hosting gig  on snl i like you just the way you are  now are you gonna kiss me or not i sure  am jasmine  [Music]  but a source tells e.t kim has been  protective of kanye and his feelings and  has been trying to keep her hangouts  with pete low key i always believe and  trust in him that he will  always eventually explain himself  because i know his heart as for her  budding romance a source told et this  week quote kim is giddy when pete's  around kim feels relaxed and comfortable  with pete and she definitely has that  new crush feeling with him
 

